# Book media is not source.
#
# 224 pictures and 519 recordings, 28 MB, all of it derived from the
# original single-file reader and regenerable from it. Committing binary
# assets that never change but are rewritten by every extraction makes
# the history heavy and the diffs useless.
#
#   npm run assets    copies them in
#   npm run book:cues regenerates the WebVTT from the timings
#
# When the art becomes something we author rather than extract, this
# decision should be revisited — probably with git-lfs.
public/art/
public/magi-audio/
public/vtt/
